; CLEAR - after "BAJAS LA ESCALERA" + fade out: LCD-off redraw, SCX=SCY=0, window and sprites off.
; Box rows 3-13, cols 0-19. Labels at col 2, values right-aligned ending at col 17
; (right end = SCREEN_CLEAR_AT_x + SCREEN_CLEAR_LEN_x - 1). Values are written by the code
; into its copy of the map before the LCD comes back on (or with the queue after the fade-in).
; '/' is DASH here until the font gets SLASH (gdd E14). "FIN DE LA DEMO" only in M1.
; "PULSA START" blinks 30/30 f. Start (or A) -> TITLE.
tilesets: ui uiscreens font
legend:
% EARTH
( EARTH_EDGE_A
) EARTH_EDGE_B
= BRICK
v MERLON_DOWN
[ FRAME_TL
_ FRAME_T
] FRAME_TR
{ FRAME_L
} FRAME_R
\ FRAME_BL
- FRAME_B
| FRAME_BR
/ DASH
: COLON
grid:
